title: "TSB-SEG: A Systematic Time-Series Segmentation Benchmark"
type: software
license: AGPL-3.0-only
repository-code: "https://github.com/fchavelli/TSB-SEG"
abstract: >-
  Code, configurations and results of TSB-SEG, a benchmark of 26 time series
  segmentation algorithms on 592 univariate and multivariate series from 8
  datasets, for change point detection and state detection.
keywords:
  - time series
  - segmentation
  - change point detection
  - state detection
